[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4320.39, "timestamp": "01:12:00", "text": "所以我尽力把它写出来了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4322.07, "timestamp": "01:12:02", "text": "中立地。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4324.55, "timestamp": "01:12:04", "text": "很难，我甚至不知道该怎么做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4328.55, "timestamp": "01:12:08", "text": "我喜欢什么，不喜欢什么。花了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4332.39, "timestamp": "01:12:12", "text": "过了一会儿，我弄明白了，然后写了下来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4333.91, "timestamp": "01:12:13", "text": "某物。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4337.03, "timestamp": "01:12:17", "text": "我意识到，当我做我的第一块切片时。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4339.189, "timestamp": "01:12:19", "text": "还有幻灯片之类的东西，我得……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4343.51, "timestamp": "01:12:23", "text": "请正确写下这些内容并展示出来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4351.669, "timestamp": "01:12:31", "text": "哦，是的。总之，呃，我们来回顾一下历史。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4354.39, "timestamp": "01:12:34", "text": "部分。历史在哪里？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4357.99, "timestamp": "01:12:37", "text": "你好。所以，我认为我们必须制定一个新的"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4359.328, "timestamp": "01:12:39", "author": "@aniketwande4403", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_m_Z2M4vVHkWPdw0fzo-i-Dy4Pm4-b-bs22Utnn5zkWBHY=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "I'll read it after the stream and we'll talk about it"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4360.95, "timestamp": "01:12:40", "text": "页。所以，我们做得差不多。我不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4364.47, "timestamp": "01:12:44", "text": "我觉得我可以复现它。所以，我就……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4372.149, "timestamp": "01:12:52", "text": "直播结束后我会看。你好。呃，新的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4374.95, "timestamp": "01:12:54", "text": "页面将"}]